  "title": {
   "en": "After School, We Wander in Space."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja-ro": "Houkago, Bokura wa Uchuu ni Madou"
   },
   {
    "ja": "放課後、僕らは宇宙に惑う"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "“That love took off suddenly, like a rocket.”\n\nThe Kinoshima Space Rocket Research Club casually uploaded a video documenting one of their hybrid engine combustion tests. But what exploded wasn’t just their dreams of reaching space—it was also the internet’s obsession with the unexpected appearance of Ayame Madoi, a member of the engine team, whose cuteness stole the show.\n\nAs the video went viral worldwide, Ayame found herself overwhelmed by the sudden fame. But deep down, there was only one person she truly wanted to think she was the cutest..."
  },
